<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1427] Scala z.show() doesn&apos;t work on v.0.6.1 ?</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1427</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The Scala Interpreter doesn&apos;t allow to show part of tables with command z.show(x,5) on the version 0.6.1. &lt;br/&gt;
It was working well with previous version of zeppelin.&lt;br/&gt;
Now, it only shows list of variables and type of those.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;zeppelin&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
