                            <comment id="15513150" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 22 Sep 2016 12:25:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user zjffdu commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1440&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1440&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    @Leemoonsoo  I added some unit test, and also fix another bug. The bug is that exception will be throw when display `Dataset`, because we assume the type of each Record is Row while it is not true for `Dataset`, so I convert `Dataset` to `DataFrame` first when displaying Dataset. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    The failed test is irrelevant. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
